# Token Estimator

Purpose:
  Estimate and record token usage per chain stage for cost control.

Owns: chains\tokens\calculator.sdd
Schema:
  stage: P1|D1|S1|C1|R1|DEP1|D0
  run_id: RUN-001
  timestamp: ISO8601
  tokens_in: number
  tokens_out: number
  tokens_delta: number
  status: started|completed|failed|retried
  parent: D0
  duration_ms: number
  retry_count: number
  error: null|string

Rates:
  small:
    prompt: 2000, docs: 5000, sdd: 8000, code: 20000,
    review: 3000, deploy: 2000, total: 40000
  medium:
    prompt: 3000, docs: 8000, sdd: 12000, code: 35000,
    review: 5000, deploy: 3000, total: 66000
  large:
    prompt: 5000, docs: 12000, sdd: 18000, code: 60000,
    review: 8000, deploy: 5000, total: 108000

Optimization:
  If over budget:
    1. Use shorter skill paths
    2. Skip optional stages
    3. Reduce context loading
    4. Use cached results

Tracking:
  File: projects/{project_name}/tokens/{node}.sdd

State: +
